{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會討論瑪麗醫院臨床大樓升降機事故／政府公布第三季經濟表現預測\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261113.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會發展事務委員會今日(11月13日)舉行特別會議，討論瑪麗醫院臨床大樓升降機事故。另外，政府經濟顧問就第三季經濟表現及本地生產總值、物價預測舉行記者會。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:24:18.899831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:27:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:46:42.876584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:17:50.970236+00:00","content_hash":"c71a9474133fd828c09f8dd1168e0947882601d26d3129c5bd700902fec3ee90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}